The ScopeProvider requires a router context with certain properties, so I've provided a mock router that includes the essential properties needed for the provider to work. The org query parameter is set to 'test-org' which will be used as the scope value.

This should resolve the "useScope must be used within a ScopeProvider" error while maintaining the original component's functionality. The component will render exactly as it does in the main application, just with the necessary context providers in place.

